<title>USA: TABLE - Orange &amp; Rockland Q2 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Orange &amp; Rockland Q2 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>PEARL RIVER 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.13   profit	 $0.41</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,694   profit	 5,564</p>
<p> Revs		     137,195		  152,254</p>
<p>		     First half</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.33   profit	 $1.42</p>
<p> Net profit		 4,522   profit	19,362</p>
<p> Revs		     322,514		  339,558</p>
