<p>(All Data Omits 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net profit and loss is net applicable to common after payment of preferred dividends.</p>
<p>Revenues are total revenues.</p>
<p>Net includes losses from discontinued NORSTAR operations of $6,705,222, or $0.50/shr, vs $509,970, or $0.04/shr, in quarter; $11,303,123, or $0.83/shr, vs $409,376, or $0.03/shr, in half; and $12,737,776, or $0.93/shr, vs $1,060,604, or $0.08/shr, in 12 months.</p>
